WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.277
[Warm Driving Acoustic Guitar and Harmonica Intro]

00:00:21.277 --> 00:00:26.500
The Maroon Express is rolling fast

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.200
Our shadows on the window glass

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.500
We're leaving campus in the dark

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.741
A single, hopeful, burning spark

00:00:37.081 --> 00:00:39.500
The eight of us, a single pack

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.000
We're never, ever going back

00:00:44.913 --> 00:00:48.776
We're leaving just a day too soon

00:00:48.896 --> 00:00:52.000
Beneath a cold November moon

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.500
My mother's cold ultimatum

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.584
Is just a fading, dying sound

00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:01.000
We're heading to a brand new place

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.500
A quiet, safe, and solid ground

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.200
This is a sanctuary

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.800
A house built on a hill

00:01:10.015 --> 00:01:13.718
A place where I can finally breathe

00:01:13.878 --> 00:01:17.500
A place where I can just be still

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:21.500
They're not just friends, I'm starting to see

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.709
They're my chosen family

00:01:25.829 --> 00:01:28.091
This basement is my sanctuary

00:01:28.091 --> 00:01:44.940
[Acoustic Guitar & Harmonica Interlude]

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:47.800
Laura's smiling at the door

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:50.500
She's happy that we're here

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.923
She doesn't see a burden

00:01:54.023 --> 00:01:56.800
She doesn't show a trace of fear

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:00.000
A full house for Thanksgiving

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.826
She says with so much joy

00:02:02.926 --> 00:02:06.500
She doesn't see a broken thing

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:10.809
She just sees... her daughter's boy

00:02:13.275 --> 00:02:16.000
This is a sanctuary

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.877
A house built on a hill

00:02:18.937 --> 00:02:22.739
A place where I can finally breathe

00:02:22.799 --> 00:02:26.500
A place where I can just be still

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:30.200
They're not just friends, I'm starting to see

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:34.043
They're my chosen family

00:02:34.183 --> 00:02:38.104
This basement is my sanctuary

00:02:44.122 --> 00:02:47.000
My sanctuary...

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.000
We're safe... We're home...

00:02:51.000 --> 00:03:09.920
[Acoustic Guitar and Harmonica Riff Fades Out]
